---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Layout title="Vedolux Lambda 350 | Smokeless Heat">
  <Header />
  <main class="pt-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-4 text-sm text-charcoal/60">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-ember">Home</a> / <a href="/products" class="hover:text-ember">Products</a> / <a href="/products/wood-boilers" class="hover:text-ember">Wood Boilers</a> / <span>Vedolux Lambda 350</span>
    </div>
    <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-8">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
        <img src="/images/products/Vedolux-Lambda-350-1.jpg" alt="Vedolux Lambda 350" class="w-full max-w-sm border border-wood/10" />
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm text-ember mb-2">Vedolux Lambda</p>
          <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-darkwood">Vedolux Lambda 350</h1>
          <div class="mt-4"><span class="text-2xl font-medium text-darkwood">$12,376.00</span></div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-charcoal/70">Wood Gasification Boiler with Lambda control</p>
          <a href="tel:8553890083" class="inline-block mt-6 bg-ember text-cream px-6 py-3 text-sm uppercase tracking-wide font-medium hover:bg-wood transition">Call to Order: 855-389-0083</a>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ember">Out of stock – no new sales</p>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-wood/10 text-sm text-charcoal/70"><span class="mr-6"><strong>SKU:</strong> 6263</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 border-t border-wood/10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-darkwood mb-6">Description</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-charcoal/90 leading-relaxed">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-darkwood">Wood Gasification Boiler with Lambda control</h3>
        <p><strong>Advantages of the Vedolux Lambda Models:</strong></p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
          <li>Firewood burning with ultimate efficiency</li>
          <li>Easy to use controller</li>
          <li>Accommodates 20" logs</li>
          <li>Simple boiler tube / flue pipe clean-out design</li>
        </ul>
        <p>The Vedolux Lambda 350 boiler works through reverse combustion with the help of a suction fan. In addition, a lambda sensor (oxygen sensor) is installed in the boiler flue that constantly analyzes how the boiler is burning by checking the proportion of oxygen in the exhaust. In real time the control makes small corrections to the air mixture to enable this boiler to reach outstanding efficiencies.</p>
        <p>The combustion chamber holds approx 3 cu.ft of firewood and accepts wood up to 20" long.</p>
        <p>When properly used and maintained the Vedolux 350 boiler has an output of around 35 kW or 120 kBTU per hour. This boiler tested at 93% efficiency when tested by the Swedish Test Institute.</p>
        <p>The Vedolux 350 must be installed with an accumulator tank. Minimum recommended storage is approximately 500 gallons.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <iframe class="w-full aspect-video" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/1qG62ewjmdw" title="Vedolux video 1" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        <iframe class="w-full aspect-video" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/zpE4rqylOPY" title="Vedolux video 2" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-8 border-t border-wood/10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-darkwood mb-4">Downloads</h2>
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <a href="/images/vedolux_lambda_brochure-4.pdf" target="_blank" class="block text-ember hover:underline">Brochure (PDF)</a>
        <a href="/images/VEDOLUX_350_2012-10-09_Smokeless-1.pdf" target="_blank" class="block text-ember hover:underline">Vedolux 350 Manual (PDF)</a>
        <a href="/images/Vedolux_3_4_650_170824_US-3.pdf" target="_blank" class="block text-ember hover:underline">Vedolux Lambda Manual after 2016 (PDF)</a>
        <a href="/images/Vedolux-350-CSA-B415.1-Efficiency-test-results-1.pdf" target="_blank" class="block text-ember hover:underline">CSA B415.1 Efficiency Report (PDF)</a>
        <a href="/images/Hangtag_V350-1.pdf" target="_blank" class="block text-ember hover:underline">EPA Burn Wise Hangtag (PDF)</a>
        <a href="/images/QuickStart_guide_350_450_650-3.pdf" target="_blank" class="block text-ember hover:underline">Quick Start Guide (PDF)</a>
        <a href="/images/Aqualux_Manual.pdf" target="_blank" class="block text-ember hover:underline">Aqualux Manual (PDF)</a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-8 border-t border-wood/10"><p class="text-sm text-charcoal/60">Legacy product. Contact Smokeless Heat for availability.</p></section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
